{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1xfNFxmdn3oeiG2Aick", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I signed off with no confirmed bugs, but confidence is only 0.5. Two of my three reports were rejected as not reproducible, and several changed-build items could not be verified.\n\n**Filed (both rejected as not reproducible):**\n1. Breakdown \"What you spent − $0\" while the sheet shows $60 Spent. I think the breakdown's spent line may be today-only in daily mode, so this may be intended.\n2. After saving a $12.5 Transport expense, the breakdown's first section still read \"$100 − $60 = $40\" while the third section read \"$100 − $72.5 = $27.5\". The developer couldn't reproduce this either.\n3. In portrait the expense list panel stayed blank after saving, while landscape showed the Transport $12.5 row and the 13 November $60 group. The developer couldn't reproduce this either.\n\n**Checked and consistent:**\n- Decimal key: \"12.5\" entry works, a second \".\" is ignored, a leading \".\" becomes \"$0.\", and the two-decimal cap holds.\n- The \"For tomorrow\" preview updates with the pending amount.\n- Persistence after backgrounding the app.\n- Analytics total ($72.5) and Categories tab (Transport) match the budget sheet.\n- Rotation keeps the entry.\n\n**Not verified:**\n- **Toolbar on category apply:** the toolbar stayed on the budget warning when I applied Food and Transport, so I couldn't tell whether it should change.\n- **Non-USD currency formatting:** I didn't change the budget currency, since that alters data.\n- **Locale decimal separator:** the device is US-locale only.\n\nI also made one unintended change: an operator-mode swipe on the sheet, which I reverted. The test entries left in the app are the $12.5 Transport expense and the $5-range amounts I cleared, so today's total is $72.5 as a result."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 883, "cache_read_input_tokens": 157798, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 883}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "fd174e7c-a964-4d9d-9e17-cd0b1d43bd1e", "uuid": "618315b1-8b79-43c7-83db-951bd2a71710", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T01:34:19.620Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch1xfN1aK3i3AFZxhc8Lk"}
